WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.371
Hi, I'm Luís.

00:00:01.509 --> 00:00:03.898
Welcome to Go Programming with GoLand,

00:00:04.123 --> 00:00:07.256
where you'll go from Go basics to a small web service.

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.625
And this is Nikolas.

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:11.483
He'll teach you slices, maps and structs,

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.472
and goroutines and channels.
